    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/3008c5f34c2e233a9840fcdc42dd2f6c.avif?t=1750703057\" /></div><br><br>Uncured revolves around a young woman named Amber who was overwhelmed by a horde of zombies on the outskirts of a city called Rosburg. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/82e6fa8dfacda6da6b0042ecb10aab4b.avif?t=1750703057\" /></div><br><br>A rogue professor managed to come across her and stabilized the infection - but time is running out as the two embark on a journey to the inner city, where an anti-virus is rumored to be in the making. <br><br><br>Use your newly gained mutational powers to your favour as you fight grotesque amalgamations, a corrupt military, and determined survivors in order to find the cure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/196eb82f3369a3ef2188de704d69a425.poster.avif?t=1750703057\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/196eb82f3369a3ef2188de704d69a425.webp?t=1750703057\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/3008c5f34c2e233a9840fcdc42dd2f6c.avif?t=1750703057\" /></div><br><br>Uncured revolves around a young woman named Amber who was overwhelmed by a horde of zombies on the outskirts of a city called Rosburg. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/82e6fa8dfacda6da6b0042ecb10aab4b.avif?t=1750703057\" /></div><br><br>A rogue professor managed to come across her and stabilized the infection - but time is running out as the two embark on a journey to the inner city, where an anti-virus is rumored to be in the making. <br><br><br>Use your newly gained mutational powers to your favour as you fight grotesque amalgamations, a corrupt military, and determined survivors in order to find the cure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/196eb82f3369a3ef2188de704d69a425.poster.avif?t=1750703057\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204990/extras/196eb82f3369a3ef2188de704d69a425.webp?t=1750703057\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "short_description": "Uncured, Unhinged, Unyielding. In this unique roguelike platformer you slash your path through masses of infectuous beasts, relentless constructs of steel, and corrupt militaries that stand between you and the antivirus. Begin your journey to the heart of the capital before the time runs out.",
